{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join forces with Sir Lionel Lancelot De L\u2019Arc \u2014 a knight of the Bourbon Roundtable, falsely branded a murderer of the King and Queen. Despised and pursued by the land he once served, Lionel fights to uncover the truth, expose the real killers, and reclaim his shattered honor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>YOKAI: The Lighting-Fast Sword</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cut through enemies in a relentless flurry of speed and precision</strong> \u2014 a ruthless dance of death so swift, so merciless, it ends before your foes even realize it has begun.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893620/extras/0939060d470d2ed6f92151b63f548cc0.poster.avif?t=1759599404\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893620/extras/0939060d470d2ed6f92151b63f548cc0.webm?t=1759599404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893620/extras/0939060d470d2ed6f92151b63f548cc0.mp4?t=1759599404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash a blinding surge of divine fury that tears through the shadows,</strong> staggering foes and leaving them helpless before your wrath.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893620/extras/b351b7a0553b65ad5e0adf295de9513c.poster.avif?t=1759599404\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893620/extras/b351b7a0553b65ad5e0adf295de9513c.webm?t=1759599404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893620/extras/b351b7a0553b65ad5e0adf295de9513c.mp4?t=1759599404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash a thunderous upward slash</strong> \u2014 a defiant arc of steel that rips through flesh, shatters will, and severs the very thread of fate.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893620/extras/026d79a0c4629c774864fe3881207bc7.poster.avif?t=1759599404\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893620/extras/026d79a0c4629c774864fe3881207bc7.webm?t=1759599404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893620/extras/026d79a0c4629c774864fe3881207bc7.mp4?t=1759599404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>SANGUIN: The Blood-Frenzy Sword</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every strike is a sweeping answer to chaos</strong> \u2014 deliberate, unhurried, and inevitable, punishing all who dare remain within its path.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893620/extras/efce1a1b6f909d58b0c94d4cb153e946.poster.avif?t=1759599404\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893620/extras/efce1a1b6f909d58b0c94d4cb153e946.webm?t=1759599404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893620/extras/efce1a1b6f909d58b0c94d4cb153e946.mp4?t=1759599404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ignite your blade with blood flame, searing through flesh and branding each wound with unending pain</strong> \u2014 a slow, crimson torment that bleeds enemies dry from the inside out.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893620/extras/a1c5e393a66e1b9fb5fbd0b0e1ca0e00.poster.avif?t=1759599404\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893620/extras/a1c5e393a66e1b9fb5fbd0b0e1ca0e00.webm?t=1759599404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893620/extras/a1c5e393a66e1b9fb5fbd0b0e1ca0e00.mp4?t=1759599404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With a thunderous crash of steel and fury, he hurls his armored shoulder into the fray</strong> \u2014 breaking ranks, shattering bones, and crushing the will to stand.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893620/extras/fa0fc754159299076261644bde2d0598.poster.avif?t=1759599404\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893620/extras/fa0fc754159299076261644bde2d0598.webm?t=1759599404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893620/extras/fa0fc754159299076261644bde2d0598.mp4?t=1759599404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>TRAVERSAL:</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn obstacles into opportunity</strong> \u2014 dash along walls with fearless precision, defying the ground beneath and ascending into places no blade was ever meant to tread, where danger hides and legends are born.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893620/extras/b55d4a4377c34553770932eb3278a29b.poster.avif?t=1759599404\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893620/extras/b55d4a4377c34553770932eb3278a29b.webm?t=1759599404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893620/extras/b55d4a4377c34553770932eb3278a29b.mp4?t=1759599404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Where nature builds its tallest walls to keep you caged, you rise</strong> \u2014 clawing past wind, stone, and gravity itself, climbing toward places never meant to be touched by mortal hands.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893620/extras/281713aed6ea04a766b1f906ecce228d.poster.avif?t=1759599404\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893620/extras/281713aed6ea04a766b1f906ecce228d.webm?t=1759599404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893620/extras/281713aed6ea04a766b1f906ecce228d.mp4?t=1759599404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The road ahead is not a path, but a test</strong> \u2014 where even solid ground deceives, and every step could be your last.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893620/extras/03fac38f030be6e7e89439c2e7d70bdb.poster.avif?t=1759599404\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893620/extras/03fac38f030be6e7e89439c2e7d70bdb.webm?t=1759599404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893620/extras/03fac38f030be6e7e89439c2e7d70bdb.mp4?t=1759599404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world wants you <strong>dead</strong>. The truth wants to stay <strong>buried</strong>. But your blade speaks <strong>louder</strong> than lies. Hunt the <strong>guilty</strong>, fight the <strong>impossible</strong>, and reclaim a name <strong>forged in steel</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3893620?t=1759599404","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3893620?t=1759599404","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893620/83f907fb416b69136ebfd7331daf71321d67367c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759599404","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893620/83f907fb416b69136ebfd7331daf71321d67367c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759599404","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Has Graphic Depiction of Violence via Sword-Fighting with Blood Shed."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join forces with Sir Lionel Lancelot De L\u2019Arc \u2014 a knight of the Bourbon Roundtable, falsely branded a murderer of the King and Queen. Despised and pursued by the land he once served, Lionel fights to uncover the truth, expose the real killers, and reclaim his shattered honor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>YOKAI: The Lighting-Fast Sword</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cut through enemies in a relentless flurry of speed and precision</s