32eb3278a29b.mp4?t=1759599404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Where nature builds its tallest walls to keep you caged, you rise</strong> \u2014 clawing past wind, stone, and gravity itself, climbing toward places never meant to be touched by mortal hands.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893620/extras/281713aed6ea04a766b1f906ecce228d.poster.avif?t=1759599404\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893620/extras/281713aed6ea04a766b1f906ecce228d.webm?t=1759599404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893620/extras/281713aed6ea04a766b1f906ecce228d.mp4?t=1759599404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The road ahead is not a path, but a test</strong> \u2014 where even solid ground deceives, and every step could be your last.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893620/extras/03fac38f030be6e7e89439c2e7d70bdb.poster.avif?t=1759599404\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893620/extras/03fac38f030be6e7e89439c2e7d70bdb.webm?t=1759599404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893620/extras/03fac38f030be6e7e89439c2e7d70bdb.mp4?t=1759599404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world wants you <strong>dead</strong>. The truth wants to stay <strong>buried</strong>. But your blade speaks <strong>louder</strong> than lies. Hunt the <strong>guilty</str